  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uovU77U.png\" alt=\"1\"></p><p><strong>Fresh Textures</strong> — 是一個獨特的資源包，由多個資源包結合而成，形成一個龐大且和諧的整體。其目標是為熟悉的原版《Minecraft》注入新活力並加以改進，賦予其新的色彩和現代化的音效。我們的主要使命是重新構想遊戲的經典紋理，為其注入生命力並激發靈感，使遊戲體驗更加精彩。此外，此資源包還提供廣泛的模組支援，使其盡可能多樣化並吸引擁有不同偏好的玩家。</p><h2>⚙️ 相容性</h2><p>建議使用以下模組以確保資源包的完整相容性：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[EMF] Entity Model Features</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[ETF] Entity Texture Features</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcit-resewn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CIT Resewn</a>（可選）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Polytone</a>（可選）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a>（可選）</li>\n</ul><h2>💬 社群</h2><p>加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/nSJBpkeVv6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器社群</a>，一起聊天、提問或分享你的創作！</p><h2>❗ 使用資源</h2><p>用於創建「FreshTextures」的資源包：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/true-harmony\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">True Harmony</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/torches-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torches Reimagined</a>&nbsp;- 使用了火炬的 3D 模型並稍作修改</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/chests-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chests Reimagined</a>&nbsp;- 使用了箱子與陷阱箱</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fextended-illumina%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended lantern</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/hidyks-realm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hidyk's Realm</a> - 大部分紋理取自於此！</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frefined-enchants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Refined Enchants</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcubic-sun-moon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cubic Sun &amp; Moon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fretextured-dye\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Retextured Dyes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fretextured-minecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Retextured Minecraft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsaddles-squared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Saddles Squared</a> - 採用 Apache-2.0 授權</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252farcheryrevamped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Archery Revamped</a> - 編輯版本</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252farmor-trim-preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Armor Trim Preview</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbrush-and-juice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brush &amp; Juice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/modded-omelet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modded Omelet - Modern Spawn Eggs</a></li>\n</ul><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:775px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/husSXOLw-iw?t=438&amp;si=zPlv-4vILgZQGNiC\" width=\"775\" height=\"455\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>",
